{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Cenas.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Welcome.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give it your best in the workshop, because here at the <strong>GunShop</strong>, we value every single worker, so get your hands dirty because the spot is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/CombatGS.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Warning.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you find yourself in any danger, the <strong>GunShop</strong> is not responsible for any damage physical or psychological on workers, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Craft.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Time.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always finish your work on time, every shift has a deadline to deliver your work, the workers that choose not to deliver in time, <span class=\"bb_strike\">are all sent to him</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Npcs.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Co-Workers.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is important to maintain communication with your coworkers, during meals every worker gathers at the cafeteria of the Gunshop to eat and socialize.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3262950?t=1744818334","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/54d5671dae21a2e6777946e1ed863aa4ee5ddcdf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744818334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/6f1f4b96b6fe514ebb6ac98a246b2f6c680867a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744818334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/6f1f4b96b6fe514ebb6ac98a246b2f6c680867a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744818334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Cenas.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Welcome.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give it your best in the workshop, because here at the <strong>GunShop</strong>, we value every single worker, so get your hands dirty because the spot is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/CombatGS.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Warning.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you find yourself in any danger, the <strong>GunShop</strong> is not responsible for any damage physical or psychological on workers, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Craft.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Time.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always finish your work on time, every shift has a deadline to deliver your work, the workers that choose not to deliver in time, <span class=\"bb_strike\">are all sent to him</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Npcs.gif?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/Co-Workers.png?t=1744818334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is important to maintain communication with your coworkers, during meals every worker gathers at the cafeteria of the Gunshop to eat and socialize.</p>","developers":["Two Shells"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/1026cd905c76e556ad818b6ffedc6c5b06bfe4f0/header.jpg?t=1744818334","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117801,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117801/movie480.mp4?t=1743176308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117801/movie_max.mp4?t=1743176308"},"name":"GunShop Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25711780